  "body": "Imagine waking up every day feeling like you're on holiday. Built in the 1980s, this resort-style townhouse development offers a relaxed, easy-care lifestyle with an impressive range of shared amenities and the beach just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nSet over a split-level layout, the home offers generous open-plan living enhanced by high-stud ceilings and a large conservatory-style dining area. A charming window seat provides the perfect spot to settle in with a good book while taking in the outlook.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is well catered for, with a substantial seaward-facing entertaining deck offering both covered and open-air spaces for year-round enjoyment. Upstairs, another deck captures the afternoon sun, providing a sheltered retreat for evening BBQs and alfresco dining.\r\n\r\nA separate, smaller room offers excellent flexibility as a study, creative studio or, as previously used, a cosy third bedroom - ideal for visiting grandchildren.\r\n\r\nCedar weatherboard and block construction provide a distinctive combination of character and practicality, complemented by a modernised kitchen and double carport.\r\n\r\nBut it's the lifestyle that really sets this property apart. Enjoy a game of tennis, take a dip in the swimming pool, or make use of the guest house when friends and family come to stay. There's also a large communal garage offering additional storage and workshop space. Better still, a private walkway leads down to idyllic Swann Beach - perfect for a refreshing morning swim.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a permanent home, a weekend escape or an easy-care lock-and-leave option, this is a place where life feels a little more like a holiday.\r\n\r\nhttps://harcourts.net/L43568468\r\n\r\nAuction 10th December at 12PM (USP)",
